  "body": "world_ossathra",
  "place": "world boss of Vharlen: the crater lake at the heart of the Caldera (zone the_caldera, levels 18-20). Arena ~50 m radius of open, walkable shore and shallow lake round her basalt island, with room for 4 basalt columns, 4 quench sluices and a magma well. Run by the realm event director (PLAN §5.2): announced 10 min ahead, free waystone travel while it runs.",
  "_doc": "Expansion 1 (Vharlen). The province WORLD BOSS. A wyrm of black scales and magma who sleeps in the crater lake. P1 'The Waking' (to 65%): a claw cone, a fire breath down a narrow cone, magma spat at random players that leaves lava pools, a wing gust down a line, and the Caldera Roar — a blast the size of the crater; hide behind a basalt column. A MAGMA WELL in the middle heals her if the tank lets her stand in it. P2 'The Lake Boils' (65% to the end of her first bar): she sinks into the boiling lake behind a ward of steam while vent wisps and salamanders come up the shore — OPEN ALL FOUR QUENCH SLUICES to flood her vents and break it — while the lake boils up in scalding pools and geysers follow everyone. P3, a new bar 'Beneath the Water': she DIVES. The lake bulges under a player (four of you hold it down), the undertow drags everyone in, lava fountains leave only four basalt islands safe, and her tail breaches in spokes; crawlers come up the shore. P4, a second new bar 'Molten Wrath': she sweeps her breath in three cones, glass falls on everyone, a ring of fire round the crater, and a last interruptible roar that brings more of the lake out. Soft enrage from 5.5 minutes, hard at 10.",
  "party": "Built for a crowd (10-60). 5 players: the soak (need 4) and the islands are the whole fight; doable but tight. 2-3: not intended — the director should not run it below ~8 players in band. M5 scaling: health and add waves by the players enrolled (PLAN §5.2); soak need = clamp(players/5, 2, 5), stack need = clamp(players/4, 3, 8); magma spit +1 per 10 players.",
  "hpMult": 10.5,
